### Build output ###
# Maven writes compiled classes and packaged artefacts here.
target/

### Eclipse and Spring Tool Suite ###
# Project metadata that these IDEs generate per machine.
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings
.springBeans
.sts4-cache

### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# Project metadata that IntelliJ generates per machine.
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

### Logs ###
# JVM crash reports and tool output. The application logs to the console only.
*.log

### Maven wrapper ###
# The wrapper script downloads this JAR on first run. The properties file stays tracked.
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

### Operating system ###
# Files that the file manager creates.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### Secrets and environment ###
# Local environment values never enter the repository. Only .env.example stays tracked.
.env
.env.*.local
.env.local

### Visual Studio Code ###
# Editor settings that VS Code stores per machine.
.vscode/